# The OpenAPI contract (TASK-325) is compared byte-for-byte by the
# `contract-freshness` CI job against a fresh `swagger:export`, which always
# writes LF (`JSON.stringify`). Pin it to LF so a Windows working tree cannot
# introduce CRLF and make that comparison — or the diff a reviewer reads —
# depend on which OS last touched the file.
apps/store-api/swagger.json text eol=lf
